>
  <h2>What The Overview Shows</h2>
  <p>
    The Overview page is built for quick checks. It brings your recent session
    metrics, streak and playtime, benchmark progress, and trend widgets into one
    place.
  </p>

  <h2>Main Widgets</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Session & Playtime:</strong> See your latest activity and current playtime
      summary.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Streak & Playtime:</strong> Track how long you've stayed active.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Session Progress:</strong> Follow your target progress at a glance.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Recent Scores:</strong> Review the latest score trend for your selected
      scenario.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Benchmark Overview:</strong> Check progress toward benchmark goals.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Performance Widgets:</strong> Compare performance versus sensitivity
      and see scenario mix trends.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How To Use It</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Open RefleK's and land on Overview.</li>
    <li>Scan the top cards to see whether you are on track.</li>
    <li>
      Use the benchmark and trend widgets to decide what to practice next.
    </li>
    <li>Jump into History when you want details about specific runs.</li>
  </ol>
</DocsLayout>
